                  <provenance type="#e" source="910"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_95">Cambridge,
                        Cambridgeshire. Dominican convent</orgName><p>'Iste fuit Fishaker fratris
                        Galfridi de Willingham et est sub custodia prioris' (c. 1300). The last
                        three words are cancelled and 'de communitate Cantebriggie'
                     substituted.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">'Istum librum ligari fecit frater Willelmus
